>
> I'm happy to announce that Linpac 0.25 has been released. This new=20
> version has some badly needed fixes to resolve known segfault issues=20
> upon start for newest Linux distros with newer GCC versions. This=20
> release also lowers the CPU load on your system when running Linpac=20
> (previously consumed an entire core). More work is needed here to get=20
> it as low as it should but this is a substantial improvement. Various=20
> other mail bugs, broken pipe errors, code cleanups, and compiler=20
> warning have been addressed.
>
